WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:05.999
Cora and Mo swam back and forth.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.215
They were thinking about the clam.

3
00:00:13.216 --> 00:00:18.159
"Clive, what can clams do?" Cora asked.

4
00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:24.196
"Well," Clive said. "We can make pearls.

5
00:00:24.197 --> 00:00:28.889
But that won't stop a fight."

6
00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:33.135
Suddenly a dark shadow passed overhead.

7
00:00:33.136 --> 00:00:36.028
Cora and Mo looked up.

8
00:00:36.029 --> 00:00:39.068
"What's that?" Mo asked.

9
00:00:39.069 --> 00:00:42.319
"A boat," Cora said.

10
00:00:42.320 --> 00:00:45.205
"Whew!" Mo said.

11
00:00:45.206 --> 00:00:48.641
"I thought it was a shark."

12
00:00:48.642 --> 00:00:51.475
Cora turned back to the clam.

13
00:00:51.476 --> 00:00:54.778
"Anyway, Clive, can you . . .

14
00:00:54.779 --> 00:00:58.968
Hey! Where's Clive?"

15
00:00:58.969 --> 00:01:06.225
Mo and Cora looked around.

16
00:01:06.226 --> 00:01:09.176
"Clive disappeared!" Mo said.

17
00:01:09.177 --> 00:01:12.090
"I don't see him anywhere.

18
00:01:12.091 --> 00:01:16.001
Maybe the compass can find him?"

19
00:01:16.002 --> 00:01:18.655
Cora looked up at the arrow.

20
00:01:18.656 --> 00:01:22.094
The arrow took off fast.

21
00:01:22.095 --> 00:01:26.408
Then it stopped and pointed down.

22
00:01:26.409 --> 00:01:34.093
"Clive?" Cora said. "Are you in that hole?"

23
00:01:34.094 --> 00:01:39.308
"Yes," Clive said. "I was afraid."

24
00:01:39.309 --> 00:01:43.593
"Did you dig this burrow by yourself?" Mo said.

25
00:01:43.594 --> 00:01:45.657
Clive nodded.

26
00:01:45.658 --> 00:01:49.394
"You're a fast digger!" Mo said.

27
00:01:49.395 --> 00:01:53.586
"That's it!" Cora smiled.

28
00:01:53.587 --> 00:01:57.763
"Clive, you're amazing!" she said.

29
00:01:57.764 --> 00:02:00.634
"I am?" Clive said.

30
00:02:00.635 --> 00:02:03.296
"Yes!" Cora said.

31
00:02:03.297 --> 00:02:06.923
"And that is how you can help!"

